<title>UK: Eksportfinans sets 100 Sfr six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eksportfinans sets 100 Sfr six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   A/S EKSPORTFINANS</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.875     MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE  S-24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
